  <title>
   <narrative xml:lang="EN">CAFOD Mano River Programme Strategy Development (Strategic Plan 2013-2015)</narrative>
  </title>
  <description>
   <narrative xml:lang="EN">CAFOD&apos;s Mano River programme is in the process of developing a new strategic plan that will guide the programme direction from the period 2013 - 2015. As part of the process of developing a Country Strategic Plan for the Mano River Programme, CAFOD provided detailed guidelines and defined the scope for this process to ensure that it is enriching, relevant and fit for purpose. 

The strategic plan will be brief, concise and actionable (not more than 10 pages and as per CAFOD&#x2019;s CSP guidelines). It will be a living document, drawing together and building on the policies and priorities agreed by CAFOD&#x2019;s team and partners in Sierra Leone and Liberia and reflect CAFOD&#x2019;s global strategy( Just One World).

The expected Outcomes  for the strategic plan are:
A clear direction  and mission statement for Mano River over the next three (3) years within CAFOD&#x2019;s global strategy
Clear defined development scenarios and imperatives  for CAFOD Mano River in the next three years
Clear strategic Objectives
Performance indicators and expected results 
An annexed resource plan</narrative>
  </description>
